! This isn't just our Lupical's problem. This is the world's problem!\"... And then rushed over to help!","nextNodeIds":[100080307]},{"nodeId":100080307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1011,"speakerName":"Razor","textMapHash":3152183434,"text":"Hm, \"Lupical\" is... \"Lupical.\"","nextNodeIds":[100080308]},{"nodeId":100080308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1011,"speakerName":"Razor","textMapHash":1835125410,"text":"I am human, but I do not need to be wolf to be \"Lupical.\" I... just want to help them.","nextNodeIds":[100080309]},{"nodeId":100080309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1534873458,"text":"Well said, Razor!","nextNodeIds":[100080310]},{"nodeId":100080310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":347508682,"text":"Maybe Lupus Boreas agreed to let the pack help...","nextNodeIds":[100080311]},{"nodeId":100080311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":779851258,"text":"Because he knows your heart.","nextNodeIds":[100080312]},{"nodeId":100080312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1011,"speakerName":"Razor","textMapHash":1858063242,"text":"You... think so?","nextNodeIds":[100080313]},{"nodeId":100080313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2357193666,"text":"Yeah, absolutely! Now, c'mon! Let's go kick some Rifthound butt!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1000803,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[20301,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LEAVE_SCENE","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT